OL,3,GNEWSAAbandoned fortress upgrade plans
OL,4,Aaim to help 'regenerate' town centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn 800-year-old former fortress is to
OL,7,Freceive a #17.7m refurbishment to be
OL,8,Ftransformed into what authorities hope
OL,9,Fwill be a major tourist attraction.
OL,11,FHaverfordwest Castle in Pembrokeshire
OL,12,Fwill be temporarily closed until 2028
OL,13,Fas it undergoes restoration that
OL,14,Fincludes grounds able to host open-air
OL,15,Fevents for 500 people.
OL,17,FPembrokeshire council said it believed
OL,18,Fthe attraction could act as an
OL,19,Fimportant hub for tourists and will
OL,20,Fsignpost visitors to other key heritage
OL,21,Fsites around the county.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
